From: MinGit BusyBox Bundle maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Windows: use Git's configured shell for LFS subprocesses

Based on git-lfs/git-lfs v3.8.1,
 a662a6dbfedf706cfa9fc7a5b7bcc7ba2e2c8a65.
Source: https://github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs
Upstream and these component modifications: MIT.
